  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "From time to time I have introduced into this newspaper column the narration of incidents that have really occurred.",
      "output_sha256": "98f3957a89244621bc4d5c1ac3c5403a7177135500a9e0bbe6d1699c9b3a2aa5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "98f3957a89244621bc4d5c1ac3c5403a7177135500a9e0bbe6d1699c9b3a2aa5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I do not mean to insinuate that in this respect it stands alone among newspaper columns.",
      "output_sha256": "447f64897264c5b112df7999e8141917f4265ce5d4bc7a98f075f5069af003ae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "447f64897264c5b112df7999e8141917f4265ce5d4bc7a98f075f5069af003ae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I mean only that I have found that my meaning was better expressed by some practical parable out of daily life than by any other method; therefore I propose to narrate the incident of the extraordinary cabman, which occurred to me only three days ago, and which, slight as it apparently is, aroused in me a moment of genuine emotion bordering upon despair.",
      "output_sha256": "9af5cfda79e7be2b252fcbd84cc90baf3a631c07dddb305c6ec9f40b08e38f65",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "9af5cfda79e7be2b252fcbd84cc90baf3a631c07dddb305c6ec9f40b08e38f65",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "On the day I met this peculiar cabman, I had just finished lunch at a quaint restaurant in Soho, surrounded by a few close friends.",
      "output_sha256": "a6595afa5d37c144ef551aaae377a15b688f2830230d59645dd541723aa67f12",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.524795,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c2609d4548c2fc14944a706cbc5bcffa8eea6e069809555306e2bd1d43e63aba"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a6595afa5d37c144ef551aaae377a15b688f2830230d59645dd541723aa67f12",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "My best friends are all either bottomless sceptics or quite uncontrollable believers, so our discussion at luncheon turned upon the most ultimate and terrible ideas.",
      "output_sha256": "88fa6e8cb09b2cfd4b117f1f178b2d95bd73eaca27e09a12500f10b89ea9fd3e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "88fa6e8cb09b2cfd4b117f1f178b2d95bd73eaca27e09a12500f10b89ea9fd3e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Ultimately, we grappled with the fundamental question: can a person truly be certain of anything?",
      "output_sha256": "02d2f8f26c19453ad6f7939445b48567d644886f9bae270e4b5e5a93c1202332",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.400791,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1ce95f20d1d387fa61381d7400d1da42c44762241158c4847573b0667416440c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "02d2f8f26c19453ad6f7939445b48567d644886f9bae270e4b5e5a93c1202332",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In my view, certainty does exist.",
      "output_sha256": "cacd3f6713f26910f6ea10e4534d88429c646edebde2c8371abf5bfa23d1170a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.400791,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1ce95f20d1d387fa61381d7400d1da42c44762241158c4847573b0667416440c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cacd3f6713f26910f6ea10e4534d88429c646edebde2c8371abf5bfa23d1170a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I think he can be certain, for if (as I said to my friend, furiously brandishing an empty bottle) it is impossible intellectually to entertain certainty, what is this certainty which it is impossible to entertain?",
      "output_sha256": "8d58c11e9a1cefc7c862842c84c8958ca14288f3b776b0167bfb702b643d76f4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "8d58c11e9a1cefc7c862842c84c8958ca14288f3b776b0167bfb702b643d76f4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If I have never experienced such a thing as certainty I cannot even say that a thing is not certain.",
      "output_sha256": "e0744c17841a988762a263945c8f6c54dbd51d95f12a54c01401e1f616fbd114",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "e0744c17841a988762a263945c8f6c54dbd51d95f12a54c01401e1f616fbd114",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Similarly, if I have never experienced such a thing as green I cannot even say that my nose is not green.",
      "output_sha256": "fc1768b836faa41012717c4430147309af8aa089c3c664ad1eeb1d1cac3540c1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "fc1768b836faa41012717c4430147309af8aa089c3c664ad1eeb1d1cac3540c1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It may be as green as possible for all I know, if I have really no experience of greenness.",
      "output_sha256": "9b346f54a5a5a550ce410140422c704946042693f6231c7eac0652b2745526dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "9b346f54a5a5a550ce410140422c704946042693f6231c7eac0652b2745526dd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "So we shouted at each other and shook the room; because metaphysics is the only thoroughly emotional thing.",
      "output_sha256": "7df15d68b66a99db480dd6d4fcf59d7b000b74aca91005a61085ad0c9d2a882d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "7df15d68b66a99db480dd6d4fcf59d7b000b74aca91005a61085ad0c9d2a882d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The divide between us ran deep, touching on the essence of broad-mindedness and intellectual openness.",
      "output_sha256": "001bedfaaf873ab1f6fa39cbefae7323a78a2d1d92b9ce9f953a18fcf30074e6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.309788,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "eae447a11704a562fd8d216828ca997232f89e0362d59bf42276d4b3fc1b1ad5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "001bedfaaf873ab1f6fa39cbefae7323a78a2d1d92b9ce9f953a18fcf30074e6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "My friend maintained that he opened his mind like the sun unfurling the fronds of a palm tree, endlessly and infinitely.",
      "output_sha256": "61631f253c563aa595216be556a3b45ce2eef6d2a8b524a4fdb6a5c75d37fbef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.508056,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "30f8cbb8b387f0eadaaba5c23f290de81b0a9d8eed90043f852c1483fb93aa37"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "61631f253c563aa595216be556a3b45ce2eef6d2a8b524a4fdb6a5c75d37fbef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I countered that I opened my mind as one opens their mouth, with the purpose of eventually closing it around something substantial.",
      "output_sha256": "1273115bc0bee57c93ff55c561feaeb8526c0a69c8c2b0da9e806525e529199f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.434091,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "aba21bb78fa38fcfb7908e66b95116ee5cf3cb9015eaf0f78ac649d47d6af6e6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1273115bc0bee57c93ff55c561feaeb8526c0a69c8c2b0da9e806525e529199f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I was, in fact, doing just that at that moment.",
      "output_sha256": "10f0a561302edda8bd4b9acc199ebb45551af103701f5b95a15a353d67fd5ad6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.579706,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "df24f1e8a87621a87f314bfa7d37522d103a888863a1e7a6b45e4088eeca89ae"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "10f0a561302edda8bd4b9acc199ebb45551af103701f5b95a15a353d67fd5ad6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I pointed out how absurd it would be to keep my mouth agape indefinitely.",
      "output_sha256": "7575c924f4762711d64f4c44990ff9b0a635e1c2f9f6b6c7375a12c3a3acd84c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.362598,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2b3697a7da6c2aa7d6eafaa5bc869d13953880b9275f77190746d31667dece26"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7575c924f4762711d64f4c44990ff9b0a635e1c2f9f6b6c7375a12c3a3acd84c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": ".....",
      "output_sha256": "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Now when this argument was over, or at least when it was cut short (for it will never be over), I went away with one of my companions, who in the confusion and comparative insanity of a General Election had somehow become a member of Parliament, and I drove with him in a cab from the corner of Leicester-square to the members’ entrance of the House of Commons, where the police received me with a quite unusual tolerance.",
      "output_sha256": "89dd9fb5a6c336eaa20b1f0575abaec85ed7eaf6ec8eae56a9110f43e330d66c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "89dd9fb5a6c336eaa20b1f0575abaec85ed7eaf6ec8eae56a9110f43e330d66c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Whether they thought that he was my keeper or that I was his keeper is a discussion between us which still continues.",
      "output_sha256": "d3e016ad9837590f43babc2e45d555cd7f7f3e91192ba08f332cb2b1f34e6ec2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "d3e016ad9837590f43babc2e45d555cd7f7f3e91192ba08f332cb2b1f34e6ec2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is necessary in this narrative to preserve the utmost exactitude of detail.",
      "output_sha256": "a7beda26c54ae039e4dc8936d930865eb969a5460dca03b2d215a88890b54970",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "a7beda26c54ae039e4dc8936d930865eb969a5460dca03b2d215a88890b54970",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "After leaving my friend at the House I took the cab on a few hundred yards to an office in Victoria-street which I had to visit.",
      "output_sha256": "2013ef6d3acd53aa8d0392f183badce8fae9aed46cfebf03899a8d6d5913d073",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "2013ef6d3acd53aa8d0392f183badce8fae9aed46cfebf03899a8d6d5913d073",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I then got out and offered him more than his fare.",
      "output_sha256": "8cb4e2719a5f6affe1fd036c869b3bd89addda904b61c41aeb3eed943c2e03ab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "8cb4e2719a5f6affe1fd036c869b3bd89addda904b61c41aeb3eed943c2e03ab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He looked at it, but not with the surly doubt and general disposition to try it on which is not unknown among normal cabmen.",
      "output_sha256": "e6a87aee83028f06e5e0aa2d24b6abd7028d084302e1e45ac7ab43896c3c7e6f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "e6a87aee83028f06e5e0aa2d24b6abd7028d084302e1e45ac7ab43896c3c7e6f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Instead of the usual skepticism or attempts to negotiate, the cabman regarded the money with a genuine and almost childlike astonishment.",
      "output_sha256": "d62e4e6401a851ed5811f94542ae3cdc63b42abf402cc0b5897ab4c4412852f0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.338417,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24,
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "58af91cff09c1e3b173dc1310f0ffa858a9671666f9a90176702fe6e4124f633",
        "e00596452beb6eee6893f70db8ab0c14f0a8b068cba43bf1172fd03ff048d2a5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d62e4e6401a851ed5811f94542ae3cdc63b42abf402cc0b5897ab4c4412852f0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“Do you know, sir,” he said, “you’ve only given me 1s.8d?”",
      "output_sha256": "42d5142b259865da6c90fca5a4b9486f2e69474d481588197067ed88b802468d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "42d5142b259865da6c90fca5a4b9486f2e69474d481588197067ed88b802468d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I responded, somewhat taken aback, that I was indeed aware of that fact.",
      "output_sha256": "8ff9c513243b486f9634883bda2bbdde736a9ae954f1a2f77fadd58b21abcc4f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.296237,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a6ba766edb2ede49e57fef2fda93a191fb043ba9cdd168c8e1636b9853d614b7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8ff9c513243b486f9634883bda2bbdde736a9ae954f1a2f77fadd58b21abcc4f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“Now you know, sir,” said he in a kindly, appealing, reasonable way, “you know that ain’t the fare from Euston.”",
      "output_sha256": "f3997c67c13c51450598ab739dc88b6b46309fd9b8d7be2b5e6e7d89f23a5824",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "f3997c67c13c51450598ab739dc88b6b46309fd9b8d7be2b5e6e7d89f23a5824",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“Euston?”",
      "output_sha256": "6884886f5af1148ce9f613a92e235849afffb7f112d145c63981e8fd23f0ef59",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.346534,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fbdef694da374b99334b521f07702b7adc8afe94615b9de13a3aab13aca383fc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6884886f5af1148ce9f613a92e235849afffb7f112d145c63981e8fd23f0ef59",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27,
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I echoed, the word sounding as foreign to me as a distant land.",
      "output_sha256": "9e13247f68be0cefaf18ae02776162ec372db93afdc33e943808ca67783e9296",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.346534,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fbdef694da374b99334b521f07702b7adc8afe94615b9de13a3aab13aca383fc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9e13247f68be0cefaf18ae02776162ec372db93afdc33e943808ca67783e9296",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27,
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“What does Euston have to do with this?”",
      "output_sha256": "7d1ae87687bf2baf59e8e3d4da74fd0db6988e50ba887b5d57e56c47b602b416",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.61,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1e71374844950d7097322a41d2288c29e322952e0f484e11d4ddac42035ea57c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7d1ae87687bf2baf59e8e3d4da74fd0db6988e50ba887b5d57e56c47b602b416",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“You hailed me just outside Euston Station,” began the man with astonishing precision, “and then you said——” “What in the name of Tartarus are you talking about?”",
      "output_sha256": "fa4b5d088f720975151a332f0d0321e995179c3fef543f0b7b9df8a1d66dac55",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "fa4b5d088f720975151a332f0d0321e995179c3fef543f0b7b9df8a1d66dac55",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I interjected, trying to maintain my composure.",
      "output_sha256": "495c9cbde6ca6aa7885ed6eceb89ad4c9708f0355e7041372bb515e754e596d4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.420556,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d557702693d1bd0a52b1f54fbaeeb9b6295acb407fb3b3c60f7d74d65407b0a8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "495c9cbde6ca6aa7885ed6eceb89ad4c9708f0355e7041372bb515e754e596d4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31,
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“I picked you up at the south-west corner of Leicester Square.”",
      "output_sha256": "976d48ca7c7509373a34cc88d9440088af24ea3340be379de805933343b17721",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.420556,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d557702693d1bd0a52b1f54fbaeeb9b6295acb407fb3b3c60f7d74d65407b0a8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "976d48ca7c7509373a34cc88d9440088af24ea3340be379de805933343b17721",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31,
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“Leicester-square,” he exclaimed, loosening a kind of cataract of scorn, “why we ain’t been near Leicester-square to-day.",
      "output_sha256": "1c704a5871fa6ba5525002efda4a96be7586ac800099c9c95651a18e835f6584",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "1c704a5871fa6ba5525002efda4a96be7586ac800099c9c95651a18e835f6584",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "You hailed me outside Euston Station, and you said——” “Are you mad, or am I?”",
      "output_sha256": "811e54c023d760f4e72502bdbe89892d2c946b3b4d5f7c8e5f60a1f0da395f47",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "811e54c023d760f4e72502bdbe89892d2c946b3b4d5f7c8e5f60a1f0da395f47",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I asked, striving to remain calm.",
      "output_sha256": "6a693e02a16760806d289e638a8f766d685acf3c102e081e715db66d387cfa4a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.557121,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "115a227b7a0182934b0463d7b990a83d6282b0aebf039b039b78d0cab5fc98f7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6a693e02a16760806d289e638a8f766d685acf3c102e081e715db66d387cfa4a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I looked at the man.",
      "output_sha256": "a6e1dd5abf8512ad312b378b0b0725c3872c4e17b3ce17529b7d38157237e30f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "a6e1dd5abf8512ad312b378b0b0725c3872c4e17b3ce17529b7d38157237e30f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "No ordinary dishonest cabman would think of creating so solid and colossal and creative a lie.",
      "output_sha256": "6f9158ac0fa5982c9b339d2df619d06d7f1340bb693c627245b848968cdffc3a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "6f9158ac0fa5982c9b339d2df619d06d7f1340bb693c627245b848968cdffc3a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And this man was not a dishonest cabman.",
      "output_sha256": "0c1b28020d024023d4d08715a84063a6fac4b25e9ad7557393b83285e5309109",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "0c1b28020d024023d4d08715a84063a6fac4b25e9ad7557393b83285e5309109",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If ever a human face was heavy and simple and humble, and with great big blue eyes protruding like a frog’s, if ever (in short) a human face was all that a human face should be, it was the face of that resentful and respectful cabman.",
      "output_sha256": "20dab3cf8b839359264b74aaab3b0d9e4a50a3041866dd90cda22cb793d09e2c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "20dab3cf8b839359264b74aaab3b0d9e4a50a3041866dd90cda22cb793d09e2c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I looked up and down the street; an unusually dark twilight seemed to be coming on.",
      "output_sha256": "53ed150684e72041991cd2a1cd7695db861cadbecfefddead55bd00328295554",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "53ed150684e72041991cd2a1cd7695db861cadbecfefddead55bd00328295554",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And for one second the old nightmare of the sceptic put its finger on my nerve.",
      "output_sha256": "f78f93efbba85f0af279e0591472be3eaff49150ee66d5b547c4c35233ca0fb3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "f78f93efbba85f0af279e0591472be3eaff49150ee66d5b547c4c35233ca0fb3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "What was certainty?",
      "output_sha256": "60f7bbb3bf4f84d6a7dc1efa65a54ae479a914ccffb05cea3e8299d78d024d7c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "60f7bbb3bf4f84d6a7dc1efa65a54ae479a914ccffb05cea3e8299d78d024d7c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Was anybody certain of anything?",
      "output_sha256": "576c7d3d5e63f73420069fe3259e77a628ef5b8c33e397aba116df5d060154c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "576c7d3d5e63f73420069fe3259e77a628ef5b8c33e397aba116df5d060154c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Heavens! to think of the dull rut of the sceptics who go on asking whether we possess a future life.",
      "output_sha256": "baba095879dbf6600f2e8b1c1e2dc6765c84b6b309bc8b28bc855418dba54539",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "baba095879dbf6600f2e8b1c1e2dc6765c84b6b309bc8b28bc855418dba54539",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The exciting question for real scepticism is whether we possess a past life.",
      "output_sha256": "bf965db2e0354b945b68eb087bd3492b15cfcdde42aa9d493bda3f2bb607c906",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "bf965db2e0354b945b68eb087bd3492b15cfcdde42aa9d493bda3f2bb607c906",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "What is a minute ago, rationalistically considered, except a tradition and a picture?",
      "output_sha256": "e7ef4994d34f0ba9570bd435a9448a313e6c3a27c934709b1a48bb5b066dee39",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "e7ef4994d34f0ba9570bd435a9448a313e6c3a27c934709b1a48bb5b066dee39",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The darkness grew deeper from the road.",
      "output_sha256": "9c0f2dc972d8e64fe74c9a5b1a434ac96c0d947ee5dc7a2ce84989f355cf4331",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "9c0f2dc972d8e64fe74c9a5b1a434ac96c0d947ee5dc7a2ce84989f355cf4331",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The cabman calmly gave me the most elaborate details of the gesture, the words, the complex but consistent course of action which I had adopted since that remarkable occasion when I had hailed him outside Euston Station.",
      "output_sha256": "2ddb435f00edcc7be9af35324cc42ab8f14951659ad2f1262cdc31ea0c5d0c26",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "2ddb435f00edcc7be9af35324cc42ab8f14951659ad2f1262cdc31ea0c5d0c26",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "How could I be certain—my skeptical friends would argue—that I hadn’t hailed him there?",
      "output_sha256": "eaf1080871fa69e03b709af588fdfa6dbd1de206df86660f8106017ef43e1719",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.55244,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f9e81a375545b15aa9a1bc21c9bf05a0ba7e5975e0e041d6ae1f364f9f68960a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "eaf1080871fa69e03b709af588fdfa6dbd1de206df86660f8106017ef43e1719",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I was firm about my assertion; he was quite equally firm about his.",
      "output_sha256": "d6e9ced1c3f8e8310fefc703a43dffedfa6059ceb85d7e8e47625d71cddb6256",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "d6e9ced1c3f8e8310fefc703a43dffedfa6059ceb85d7e8e47625d71cddb6256",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "He was as honest as I was, a representative of a profession I considered far more reputable than many.",
      "output_sha256": "adeac9452980874e506b998a2f65e38c8b1fd9515fb86899583262f058a6db48",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.546842,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b56f48d02f5349f8efaa2e8995d240758045a4958eb0ca1cfb221aa0aa1ea02f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "adeac9452980874e506b998a2f65e38c8b1fd9515fb86899583262f058a6db48",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "At that instant, it felt as though the universe itself had shifted slightly, unsettling the very foundations of reality.",
      "output_sha256": "7a01927e5170e1a0373442390607406ade61defef905f6e807bd57a8eb632968",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": 0.313915,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ce59571835a905260c0053265eb50be21626190f44449661dc8647c43a245be8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7a01927e5170e1a0373442390607406ade61defef905f6e807bd57a8eb632968",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But for the same reason that I believe in Democracy, for the same reason that I believe in free will, for the same reason that I believe in fixed character of virtue, the reason that could only be expressed by saying that I do not choose to be a lunatic, I continued to believe that this honest cabman was wrong, and I repeated to him that I had really taken him at the corner of Leicester-square.",
      "output_sha256": "a04302ea1c16e269ee04e08eab64be454ffedbf271ec1614fc3b6556ef53e066",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "a04302ea1c16e269ee04e08eab64be454ffedbf271ec1614fc3b6556ef53e066",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "He persisted with his unwavering sincerity, “You hailed me outside Euston Station, and you said—”",
      "output_sha256": "19f5270bb5fe700993887b5afc3e642db86b597c1b3ad088486e23afffc5fae1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.693939,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c3cc8b72845cb21c5cb17a68829c00d4efbdefc34280a05219da51313ff8582a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_ai_sha256": "19f5270bb5fe700993887b5afc3e642db86b597c1b3ad088486e23afffc5fae1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And at this moment there came over his features a kind of frightful transfiguration of living astonishment, as if he had been lit up like a lamp from the inside.",
      "output_sha256": "7bba08440f6ab0f29b7244f1a9dd5651b3fad8dd370105fb592d866500ef125d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "7bba08440f6ab0f29b7244f1a9dd5651b3fad8dd370105fb592d866500ef125d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“Why, I beg your pardon, sir,” he said.",
      "output_sha256": "7b9cc33d8f0b1082d4c4f9e6c5dd90061b7ea65c591a077381e20716b464275a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "7b9cc33d8f0b1082d4c4f9e6c5dd90061b7ea65c591a077381e20716b464275a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“I beg your pardon.",
      "output_sha256": "9a5704c38754814d1ccff028295f4038cd287e682683ef147fd5e8863b5478ca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "9a5704c38754814d1ccff028295f4038cd287e682683ef147fd5e8863b5478ca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I beg your pardon.",
      "output_sha256": "5924b90044da23372fee763b3e0b6ffbfac38c6db4acb561ed638b877fb40482",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "5924b90044da23372fee763b3e0b6ffbfac38c6db4acb561ed638b877fb40482",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "You took me from Leicester-square.",
      "output_sha256": "56faced237ef7c58059cb8b56ce88a38df3322e406352de074b8fcafadb291c5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "56faced237ef7c58059cb8b56ce88a38df3322e406352de074b8fcafadb291c5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I remember now.",
      "output_sha256": "621371f6bf8b609bf1835d1fa566ac6cf80d57b0e7d548977401733a7c92530f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "621371f6bf8b609bf1835d1fa566ac6cf80d57b0e7d548977401733a7c92530f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I beg your pardon.”",
      "output_sha256": "07e1a62e356fe95a7510986daa09d765eb993cfc6a1e98b899205f286f2cb409",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "07e1a62e356fe95a7510986daa09d765eb993cfc6a1e98b899205f286f2cb409",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And with that this astonishing man let out his whip with a sharp crack at his horse and went trundling away.",
      "output_sha256": "afe9ddcda360a41788527e311fe114a3f75b1e6d76ee2f3af7a51e4428a144c1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_human_sha256": "afe9ddcda360a41788527e311fe114a3f75b1e6d76ee2f3af7a51e4428a144c1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I solemnly swear, under the banner of St. George, that this entire encounter is true.",
      "output_sha256": "07bc4a8790343160f3b6e42e73d42e1d24c64efbaaad5f60bf56cb47bb92d96d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": 0.539444,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        63,
        64
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "28473db6444a47c98695fb87e5ed2f77d588dbc1b7b60f372a9618320d0f7f07",
        "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870"
      ],
